  "tooltip_enus": "<table><tr><td><b>Combat Augmentation Kit</b><br />Instant cast</td></tr></table><table><tr><td><span class=\"q\">Grants you 3 <span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Combat Augments</span> you can apply to your <span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Clockwork Assistant</span>. <br /><br />Only 1 <span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Combat Augment</span> can be active at a time.<br /><span class='iconsmall'><ins style='background-image: url(\"https://db.ascension.gg/static/images/wow/icons/small/5_music_border.jpg\");'></ins><del></del></span>\n                            <a style='color: white !important' href='?spell=704439'> Bard's Harp </a> <br />\n                            <span> Visually transform your shield into a Lyre.</span><br /><br /><span class='iconsmall'><ins style='background-image: url(\"https://db.ascension.gg/static/images/wow/icons/small/ability_rogue_cannonballbarrage.jpg\");'></ins><del></del></span>\n                            <a style='color: white !important' href='?spell=704441'> Combat Augment: Flame Jets </a> <br />\n                            <span> Gives the bot a chance to spill flames on enemies in a cone whenever it lands a critical strike, causing an additional 14 to 16 Fire damage plus 20 to 25 over 10&nbsp;sec. Scales with the Tinker's attack power and spell power.</span><br /><br /><span class='iconsmall'><ins style='background-image: url(\"https://db.ascension.gg/static/images/wow/icons/small/inv_eng_gearspringparts.jpg\");'></ins><del></del></span>\n                            <a style='color: white !important' href='?spell=704443'> Combat Augment: Hydraulic Springs </a> <br />\n                            <span> The bot's unique abilities have 50% reduced cooldowns but deal 25% less damage.</span><br /></span></td></tr></table><!--?806614:1:1:80-->",
